ltimate prison escape experience, we are excited to announce that we are currently hard at work on a brand-new, massive map! What can you expect from the new map? 20x Larger Map Area: The original areas were just the beginning. The new map expands the prison complex to an ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T15:04:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067936465","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4964620-1845383656383950","game_id":"steam-4964620","kind":"update","title":"Update Release: Kitchen & Workshop Tasks, Advanced Hacking, Craftable Shie","summary":"Update Release: Objective List, Kitchen & Workshop Tasks, Advanced Hacking, Craftable Shields & AI Rework!Hello, inmates and operatives! We are thrilled to release our latest update! Today’s patch introduces exciting new gameplay tasks, expanded stealth mechanics, craftable defenses, a new Objective List to guide your escape, and a complete rework of guard AI that opens up powerful new co-op tactical plays. Here is everything new in this update: New Feature: Objective ListNever feel lost again! ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T20:39:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656383950","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4964620-1842846814441789","game_id":"steam-4964620","kind":"update","title":"Graphic Update: Enhanced Levels & Refined Prison Atmosphere","summary":"MAJOR UPDATE: Graphical Overhaul & Atmospheric Polish We are excited to announce that a massive Graphic Update has just arrived! We have been working hard to push the game’s visual standard to a whole new level, and this update is fully available in the free demo version as well. What’s New? Enhanced Level Design: Environments across the demo have received upgraded textures, improved lighting, and refined visual elements. Refined Visual Identity: We have unified the game’s visual style to delive","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T00:12:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814441789","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4964620-1842212951297483","game_id":"steam-4964620","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Improved NPC Interactions, Quests, Trading & Balanced Economy!","summary":"Hey inmates!We’ve just released a major update to The Yard: Escape from Prison Demo, focusing on interactions, progression, and overall game economy!Here is what’s new in this update:Enhanced NPC Communication & Quests: Talking to NPCs is now smoother and more responsive. We’ve overhauled the quest interface so you can easily track your tasks, progress, and rewards.In-Game Trading & Shop System: You can now spend your hard-earned cash! Buy essential items directly from vendors and fellow inmates","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T16:33:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951297483","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4964620-1841579228671508","game_id":"steam-4964620","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update Live: Steam Overlay Invites & Solitary Confinement Minigame!","summary":"Hey inmates!We’ve just pushed a fresh update to The Yard: Escape from Prison Demo to fix a few key issues and introduce a fun new mechanic for when you get caught breaking the rules!Here is what’s new in this update:Steam Overlay Invite Fix: Fixed the bug preventing players from properly sending and receiving lobby invites through the Steam Overlay. Inviting your crew to plan a breakout together is now seamless and reliable!Solitary Confinement Minigame: Got caught by the guards and thrown into ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T14:26:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228671508","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4964620-1841579228665157","game_id":"steam-4964620","kind":"announcement","title":"The Yard: Escape from Prison Demo is Now Live – Play for Free!","summary":"Hey inmates!The wait is over! The official demo for The Yard: Escape from Prison is officially live and free to play right now on Steam!Get a taste of what life behind bars feels like—and more importantly, how you’re going to escape it. Whether you play solo, on the couch with a friend via split-screen, or online in up to 6-player co-op, your journey to freedom starts today!What you can experience in the Demo:Follow the Routine: Stick to daily chores, attend roll calls, and stay under the radar ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T10:55:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228665157","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4964620":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:57:22Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:39:46Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4964620":"2026-10-26T15:57:22Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4964620":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:39:46Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:39:46Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:39:46Z"},"5036690":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15